"https://linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F241304024828157%2Fposts%2F1395530956072119&title=%09%09%09%09%09%09%09%09%09REST+IN+PEACE%2C+AMERICAN+SOLDIER+Today+I+had+the+honor+of+attending+the+funeral+of+SFC+Trevor+Robert+Turner+at+our+Massachusetts+National+Cemetery+in+Bourne.Trevor+was+only+40+years+old.+He+was+a+brave+soldier%2C+a+father+of+two%2C+and+a+still-serving+member+of+the+Massachusetts+Army+National+Guard%E2%80%99s+101st+Field+Artillery.+He+served+his+country+for+14+years+and+always+looked+out+for+his+fellow+soldiers.So+many+people+came+out+today+to+honor+Trevor+and+stand+beside+his+family.+The+United+States+Army+ceremonial+unit+conducted+full+military+honors%2C+and+it+was+absolutely+incredible.I+will+never+forget+the+sound+of+those+howitzers+blasting+as+part+of+the+final+salute+to+their+fallen+brother.As+a+Gold+Star+father%2C+I+know+what+it+is+like+to+lose+a+child+in+service.++My+heart+breaks+for+Trevor%E2%80%99s+family%2C+and+especially+his+children%2C+Abigail+and+Devin.+No+family+should+ever+have+to+go+through+this.Today+was+another+reminder+of+the+brave+men+and+women+serving+all+around+us+who+put+on+the+uniform+to+defend+our+country.+We+should+never+take+that+for+granted.+Their+service+comes+at+a+price%2C+and+Trevor%E2%80%99s+family+is+now+living+with+that+sacrifice+every+day.God+bless+Trevor%2C+his+family%2C+and+all+who+serve.Rest+easy%2C+SFC+Turner.+%F0%9F%87%BA%F0%9F%87%B8%E2%AD%90%EF%B8%8F%F0%9F%99%8F%F0%9F%8F%BB%F0%9F%AB%A1%23RepX+%23Fightin5th+%23ServiceBeforeSelf+%23ProudAmerican+%23USArmy+%23HonorAndRemember+%23AmericanSoldier+%23CapeCod+%23Massachusetts+%23MaPoliMassachusetts+National+CemeteryU.S.+Army+%09%09%09%09%09%09%09%09%09",
